TrackCats
An unofficial fan-made seed tracker for The Battle Cats. Not affiliated with or endorsed by PONOS.

This app includes a Kotlin port of roll-simulation and seed-search logic from:

  battle-cats-rolls by godfat (Lin Jen-Shin) and contributors
  https://gitlab.com/godfat/battle-cats-rolls
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The ported parts are app/src/main/java/com/trackcats/app/core/Engine.kt and SeedFinder.kt
(the seed search follows the approach of Seeker-VampireFlower.c in that project).

Banner and cat data (app/src/main/assets/gamedata.json, and the file the app downloads at
runtime) are derived from that project's build/bc-en.yaml. Cat names, banner names and game
data belong to PONOS.
